#. type: Title =
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/course-review.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Course review"
msgstr "課程回顧"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/course-review.adoc:5
msgid "Review concepts covered in this course."
msgstr "回顧本課程所涵蓋的觀念。"

#.  Note the lack of empty lines between the end of the question (....) and the start of the next question
#.  (. What…) is required, so I have added // comments to help separate them.
#.  The + connects the question into the numbered list item, see https://docs.asciidoctor.org/asciidoc/latest/lists/continuation/
#.  Question 1
#. type: delimited block *
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/course-review.adoc:12
#: en/intro-to-gbif/modules/ROOT/pages/data-access.adoc:130
msgid "How can you access GBIF data?"
msgstr "你要如何存取 GBIF 資料呢？"

#. type: delimited block .
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/course-review.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "- [x] GBIF.org search interface\n"
"- [x] GBIF API\n"
"- [x] rgbif\n"
msgstr "- [x] GBIF.org 搜尋介面\n"
"- [x] GBIF API\n"
"- [x] rgbif\n"

#.  Question 2
#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/course-review.adoc:21
#: en/intro-to-gbif/modules/ROOT/pages/data-access.adoc:141
msgid "Which file formats are available for downloads of data?"
msgstr "資料下載支援哪些檔案格式？"

#. type: delimited block .
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/course-review.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "- [x] Simple\n"
"- [ ] XML\n"
"- [x] Darwin Core Archive\n"
"- [x] Species list\n"
msgstr "- [x] 簡易\n"
"- [ ] XML\n"
"- [x] 達爾文核心集檔案\n"
"- [x] 物種清單\n"

#.  Question 3
#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/course-review.adoc:31
msgid "Who determines if a dataset is fit for use?"
msgstr "由誰來決定一組資料集是否適合使用？"

#. type: delimited block .
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/course-review.adoc:38
#: en/foundations/modules/ROOT/pages/foundations-review.adoc:246
#, no-wrap
msgid "- [ ] The museum or department director\n"
"- [x] The users of the data for research or education\n"
"- [ ] The collector of the data in the field\n"
"- [ ] The person entering the data into the database\n"
msgstr "- [ ] 博物館或部門主管\n"
"- [x] 將資料用於研究或教育之使用者\n"
"- [ ] 該領域資料的蒐集者\n"
"- [ ] 將資料輸入資料庫之人\n"

#.  Question 4
#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/course-review.adoc:41
msgid "Which of these aspects do you need to consider when assessing if a GBIF-mediated dataset is fit for use?"
msgstr "在評估 GBIF 提供的資料集是否適合使用時，您需要考慮以下哪些方面？"

#. type: delimited block .
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/course-review.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "- [x] The number of data points\n"
"- [x] The spatial resolution of the data\n"
"- [x] Dataset metadata\n"
"- [x] The species identification\n"
msgstr "- [x] 資料點數量\n"
"- [x] 資料的空間解析度\n"
"- [x] 資料集詮釋資料\n"
"- [x] 物種鑑定\n"

#.  Question 6
#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/course-review.adoc:51
msgid "Which of these would you consider to be accurate data?"
msgstr "在以下這些資料中，您認為哪一項是準確的？"

#. type: delimited block .
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/course-review.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "- [x] Data where the coordinates match the country information\n"
"- [ ] Data where the higher taxonomy of a species does not reflect the current taxonomy of a species\n"
msgstr "- [x] 座標與國家資訊相符的資料\n"
"- [ ] 物種的高階分類未反映該物種現行分類學的資料\n"

#.  Question 7
#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/course-review.adoc:59
msgid "Which of these are some common GBIF data quality issues?"
msgstr "以下哪些屬於 GBIF 常見的資料品質問題？"

#. type: delimited block .
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/course-review.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "- [x] Duplicates of occurrence data\n"
"- [x] Gridded datasets\n"
"- [x] Country centroids\n"
"- [x] Coordinate mismatches\n"
msgstr "- [x] 出現紀錄資料重複\n"
"- [x] 網格化資料集\n"
"- [x] 國家中心點\n"
"- [x] 座標不符\n"

#.  Question 3
#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/course-review.adoc:69
#: en/intro-to-gbif/modules/ROOT/pages/data-access.adoc:152
msgid "What kind of flags does GBIF apply to data to alert you to the quality?"
msgstr "GBIF 會對資料套用哪些標記，以提醒您注意資料品質？"

#. type: delimited block .
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/course-review.adoc:78
#: en/intro-to-gbif/modules/ROOT/pages/data-access.adoc:161
#, no-wrap
msgid "- [x] altered\n"
"- [ ] amended\n"
"- [ ] translated\n"
"- [x] excluded\n"
"- [ ] interpreted\n"
"- [x] inferred\n"
msgstr "- [x] 修改\n"
"- [ ] 修訂\n"
"- [ ] 翻譯\n"
"- [x] 排除\n"
"- [ ] 詮釋\n"
"- [x] 推論\n"

#.  Question 9
#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/course-review.adoc:81
msgid "Which of the following data quality checks cannot be performed automatically by GBIF?"
msgstr "下列哪一項資料品質檢查無法由 GBIF 自動執行？"

#. type: delimited block .
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/course-review.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "- [ ] Duplicate publication of the same occurrence\n"
"- [ ] Coordinate inversions\n"
"- [ ] Missing higher taxonomy\n"
"- [x] Incorrect identification of a taxon\n"
msgstr "- [ ] 同一記錄的重複發布\n"
"- [ ] 座標顛倒\n"
"- [ ] 缺少較高分類\n"
"- [x] 分類單元鑑定錯誤\n"

#.  Question 10
#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/course-review.adoc:91
msgid "Which of the following is not an issue flag?"
msgstr "下列哪一項不屬於問題標記？"

#. type: delimited block .
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/course-review.adoc:98
#, no-wrap
msgid "- [ ] Country coordinate mismatch\n"
"- [ ] Taxon match fuzzy\n"
"- [ ] Basis of record invalid\n"
"- [x] Outside native range\n"
msgstr "- [ ] 國家座標不符\n"
"- [ ] 分類單元匹配不精確\n"
"- [ ] 記錄依據無效\n"
"- [x] 超出原生分布範圍\n"

